stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Pending : executions row inserted inside the event transaction
    Pending --> Completed : Complete then the transaction commits
    Pending --> Failed : Fail with an error message
    Pending --> Quarantined : Quarantine a permanent failure
    Completed --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
    Quarantined --> [*]

    note right of Pending
        Complete, Fail and Quarantine are only
        valid from pending. Any other source
        state returns ErrInvalidExecutionStatus.
        The row, the inbox mark and the outbox
        effects commit atomically together.
        Status values are pending, completed,
        failed and quarantined.
    end note
